sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant UI as React App UI
    participant LS as localStorage
    participant API as Express API
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant Admin as Admin Panel

    User->>UI: Open app and browse products
    UI-->>User: Show Home Collections Product pages

    alt Register
        User->>UI: Submit register form
        UI->>API: POST /api/register
        API->>DB: Insert user
        DB-->>API: Success
        API-->>UI: Registration response
        UI->>LS: Save user session
        UI-->>User: Redirect to Home
    else Login
        User->>UI: Submit login form
        UI->>API: POST /api/login
        API->>DB: Fetch user by email
        DB-->>API: User record
        API-->>UI: Login success with role
        UI->>LS: Save user session and role
        UI-->>User: Redirect Home or Admin
    end

    User->>UI: Add item to cart
    UI->>LS: Save cart items
    LS-->>UI: Cart updated event
    UI-->>User: Cart count updated

    User->>UI: Proceed to checkout
    UI->>LS: Read cart and saved address
    UI-->>User: Show checkout summary

    alt Buy flow
        User->>UI: Fill address and continue
        UI-->>User: Open payment page
    else Rent flow
        User->>UI: Select dates and upload ID
        UI-->>User: Open payment page
    end

    User->>UI: Confirm payment method and pay
    UI-->>User: Process payment animation
    UI-->>User: Order confirmed screen
    UI-->>User: Track order or My Rentals and Orders

    User->>UI: Open Contact Support
    UI-->>User: Submit support ticket confirmation

    alt Admin access
        User->>UI: Open Admin Dashboard
        UI->>LS: Check user role admin
        UI->>Admin: Load admin modules
        Admin->>LS: Read admin_orders admin_rentals admin_products
        LS-->>Admin: Current admin data
        Admin-->>User: Show live dashboard stats
        User->>Admin: Update orders rentals products
        Admin->>LS: Persist updates
        Admin-->>User: Refresh dashboard with new values
    end
